# Call the API same-origin so requests go through the Cloudflare Pages Function
# proxy (functions/api/[[path]].ts), which terminates TLS at the nearest edge
# and edge-caches public reads. Leaving this as "/" routes /api/* and /health to
# the proxy instead of the US origin directly.
#
# IMPORTANT: if the Cloudflare Pages project defines VITE_API_BASE_URL in its
# dashboard, that value overrides this file. Remove it (or set it to "/") there.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/
